  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Since the transformer is assumed to be purely resistive, the power of the transformer can be calculated with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>R</mi></mfrac></math>. Therefore,</p><p>For the primary coil,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p><p>For the secondary coil,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mn>160</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>32</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
